    "work_id": "oglt-pl/chlodovechus-i/pl72_55_v.",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.V.3.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nam de his qui in pate nostra, tam clerici quam laici, subrepti fuerint, si veraciter agnoscitis,",
